### 수정 전 경찰관 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/officers/1001
Accept: application/json

### 경찰관 닉네임만 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/officers/1001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nickname": "주디 반장"
}

### 공백 닉네임 수정 거부 확인
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/officers/1001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nickname": "   "
}

### 존재하지 않는 경찰관 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/officers/99999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nickname": "테스트"
}

### 경찰관 여러 필드 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/officers/1001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nickname": "주디 홉스",
  "name": "주디 홉스",
  "species": "RABBIT",
  "size": "MEDIUM",
  "district": "RAINFOREST"
}

### 테스트 후 원래 값으로 복원
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/officers/1001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "size": "SMALL",
  "district": "DOWNTOWN"
}